{"sha": "0a4dbc820a647a360a6f40e1e6a30360275b44a4a4ecb1c0005f9a08608130fc", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:precipitation} 章 --- 沉淀与溶解度}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:1}", "\\ce{BaSO4(s) <=> Ba^2+ + SO4^2-}，$K_s = [\\ce{Ba^2+}][\\ce{SO4^2-}] =", "10^{-9.97}$。\\ce{CaF2(s) <=> Ca^2+ + 2F-}，$K_s = [\\ce{Ca^2+}][\\ce{F-}]^2 =", "10^{-9.84}$。\\ce{Ag2CrO4(s) <=> 2Ag+ + CrO4^2-}，$K_s =", "[\\ce{Ag+}]^2[\\ce{CrO4^2-}] = 10^{-11.95}$。\\ce{Fe(OH)3(s) <=> Fe^3+ + 3OH-}，", "$K_s = [\\ce{Fe^3+}][\\ce{OH-}]^3 = 10^{-38.55}$。对于 $K_s = \\num{2.0e-13}$，", "$\\mathrm{p}K_s = 12.70$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:2}", "$s = \\sqrt{K_s} = 10^{-12.27/2} = \\qty{7.3e-7}{mol/L}$，即", "$\\num{7.3e-7} \\times 187.8 = \\qty{1.4e-4}{g/L} = \\qty{0.14}{mg/L}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:3}", "混合后（体积加倍），$[\\ce{Ba^2+}] = \\qty{1.0e-3}{mol/L}$，", "$[\\ce{SO4^2-}] = \\qty{1.0e-4}{mol/L}$：$Q_s = \\num{1.0e-7} > K_s =", "\\num{1.1e-10}$，硫酸钡沉淀。第二种情形中", "$[\\ce{SO4^2-}] = \\num{1.0e-7}$，$Q_s = \\num{1.0e-10} < K_s$，", "无沉淀生成，但差距很小。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:4}", "在水中 $s = 10^{-9.97/2} = \\qty{1.0e-5}{mol/L}$。在 \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}", "硫酸根溶液中（\\cref{prop:b1:precipitation:common-ion}），$s = 10^{-9.97}/0.010 =", "\\qty{1.1e-8}{mol/L}$，约小一千倍（倍数为 970）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:5}", "在水中 $s = (10^{-9.84}/4)^{1/3} = \\qty{3.3e-4}{mol/L}$，即", "\\qty{26}{mg/L}。在 \\qty{0.10}{mol/L} 氯化钙溶液中，", "$[\\ce{Ca^2+}] \\approx 0.10$，$[\\ce{F-}] = 2s$，因此", "$s = \\frac12\\sqrt{10^{-9.84}/0.10} = \\qty{1.9e-5}{mol/L}$。近似", "$s \\ll 0.10$ 成立，两者相差四个数量级。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:6}", "开始沉淀时：$\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 - \\frac12(11.25 + \\log 0.050) = 14.00 - 4.97 =", "9.03$。沉淀率达 \\qty{99}{\\percent} 时，$[\\ce{Mg^2+}] = \\num{5.0e-4}$，", "$\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 - \\frac12(11.25 - 3.30) = 10.03$。在 pH 轴上，", "\\ce{Mg(OH)2} 在 9.03 以上存在；在其以下，镁完全以 \\ce{Mg^2+}", "形式存在，浓度为 \\qty{0.050}{mol/L}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:7}", "溴化银先沉淀，此时 $[\\ce{Ag+}] = 10^{-12.27 + 2} =", "10^{-10.27}$，氯化银在 $10^{-7.75}$ 时沉淀。当氯化银开始沉淀时，", "$[\\ce{Br-}] = 10^{-12.27}/10^{-7.75} = 10^{-4.52} =", "\\qty{3.0e-5}{mol/L}$，为溴离子的 \\qty{0.30}{\\percent}。", "按通常的 \\qty{0.1}{\\percent} 判据，此分离不可接受：两者的", "$\\mathrm{p}K_s$ 仅相差 2.5。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:8}", "铬酸银在 $[\\ce{Ag+}]^2 \\times \\num{5.0e-3} = 10^{-11.95}$ 时生成，", "$[\\ce{Ag+}] = \\qty{1.5e-5}{mol/L}$。此时 $[\\ce{Cl-}] = 10^{-9.75}/\\num{1.5e-5}", "= \\qty{1.2e-5}{mol/L}$，占氯离子的 \\num{2.4e-4}（\\qty{0.024}{\\percent}）。", "红色出现时，氯离子实际上已", "基本全部沉淀。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:9}", "$[\\ce{CO3^2-}] = [\\ce{HCO3-}]K_{a2}/[\\ce{H3O+}] = [\\ce{HCO3-}]\\,10^{\\mathrm{pH}", "- \\mathrm{p}K_{a2}}$，故 $K_s = [\\ce{Ca^2+}][\\ce{HCO3-}]\\,10^{\\mathrm{pH} -", "\\mathrm{p}K_{a2}}$，即所求关系式。取 $[\\ce{Ca^2+}] =", "[\\ce{HCO3-}] = s$，则 $s^2 = 10^{-8.30 + 10.33 - 8.30} = 10^{-6.27}$，", "$s = \\qty{7.3e-4}{mol/L}$（\\ce{CaCO3} 为 \\qty{73}{mg/L}），若碳酸根离子不是碱，则为", "$10^{-4.15} = \\qty{7.1e-5}{mol/L}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:10}", "1.~加入 \\ce{CO2(g) <=> CO2(aq)}：$K' = K K_H = 10^{-4.34 - 1.47} =", "10^{-5.81}$。", "2.~$[\\ce{Ca^2+}] = s$，$[\\ce{HCO3-}] = 2s$，故 $4s^3 = K'p$。在", "\\qty{0.010}{bar} 下：$s = (10^{-5.81} \\times 0.010/4)^{1/3} =", "\\qty{1.6e-3}{mol/L}$，即 \\qty{157}{mg/L}。在室外空气中：", "$s = \\qty{5.5e-4}{mol/L}$，即 \\qty{55}{mg/L}。（验证：在土壤空气中", "$[\\ce{CO2(aq)}] = 10^{-3.47}$，$\\mathrm{pH} = 6.37 + \\log(3.14\\times", "10^{-3}/3.39 \\times 10^{-4}) = 7.34$：碳酸氢根确实占优势。）", "3.~在土壤中二氧化碳压强较高的条件下，水中已饱和了方解石，", "这些水到达洞顶，那里压强较低，于是失去二氧化碳，", "$Q > K'$，方解石便在水滴悬挂之处沉淀，", "一圈圈地生成。", "% ledger: air:CO2, dfg:CO2_g, dfg:CO2_ao (log KH computed in figdata/bachelor-1/aqueous-constants.py)", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:11}", "1.~开始沉淀时 $\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 - \\frac12(16.38 - 2.00) = 6.81$。完全", "重新溶解时 $[\\ce{Zn(OH)4^2-}] = 10^{-2} = 10^{-1.93}[\\ce{OH-}]^2$，", "$[\\ce{OH-}] = 10^{-0.035}$，$\\mathrm{pH} = 13.97$。氢氧化物存在于", "pH 6.81 至 13.97 之间。", "2.~$\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 - 14.45/4 = 10.39$，$s_{\\min} = 2 \\times", "10^{-(16.38 + 1.93)/2} = \\qty{1.4e-9}{mol/L}$（在此双物种模型中）。", "3.~斜率为 $-2$ 的直线从 $(6.81, -2)$ 下降到极小值附近的", "$(10.39, -8.9)$，再以斜率 $+2$ 上升到 $(13.97, -2)$；真实曲线", "因其他羟基配合物的作用而圆滑化", "（见\\cref{sec:b1:precipitation:amphoteric}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:precipitation:12}", "1.~$\\ce{Al(OH)3(s) + OH- <=> Al(OH)4-}$，$K = 10^{-1.23}$；所有的", "铝都溶解时，$10^{-3} \\leqslant K[\\ce{OH-}]$，即", "$[\\ce{OH-}] \\geqslant 10^{-1.77}$，$\\mathrm{pH} \\geqslant 12.23$。", "2.~$[\\ce{Fe^3+}] = 10^{-38.55}/10^{-3 \\times 1.77} = 10^{-33.2}$：铁", "完全以 \\ce{Fe(OH)3} 的形式存在；过滤将铁（固体）", "与铝（滤液）分离。", "3.~氢氧化镁不具两性：在过量的氢氧化物中，它仍为固体，", "与氢氧化铁（III）一起，无法实现分离。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}